description_preview:
VisionNav® Robotics is a leading global supplier of autonomous industrial vehicles and intralogistics automation
solutions. We are hiring for a Project Application Engineer to join the growing team. This role is focused on
implementation of AGV project, the installation and debugging of robot automation.This is a
great opportunity to get into a small company that is growing fast and has unlimited
potential.
Qualifications
1. AGF onsite deployment, debugging, troubleshooting and customer training in overseas
project;
2. AGF operational status tracking, recording and summarizing in overseas project onsite,
and regularly reporting to project manager;
3. Responsible for project documentations;
4. After-sales repair and maintenance;
5. Develop and follow up project schedule plan for overseas projects, communication and
coordinate with customers for technical problems;
6. Timely feedback customer requirement, constantly improve project management skills
and improve customer service level;
Complete other tasks assigned by the manager;
Requirements
1. Familiar with CAD, SolidWorks, Excel, Word, PPT and other office software;
2. Good learning ability;
3. Good communication skills is preferred
4. Enthusiastic in work, strong adaptability and stress resistance, good teamwork spirit and
customer service awareness, able to travel
5. Having experience in electrical automation industry and FAE work experience is preferred;
6. Having experience in AGV, AGF or forklift maintenance is preferred.
